# The Prolog backend's preset with the fixed-width integers: the base preset
# (prolog_backend_preset.lambdalattice) and the native typing of the words,
# enabled together with the backend's representation of them, as one module
# (CONTRIBUTING.md, "Efficiency by design, with native structures"). It extends the base preset,
# which it imports whole, since fixed_width_shapes is compiled with
# prolog_backend_shapes: enabling it always brings the backend along.
#
# The fixed-width typing is fixed_width_unions (the words' schemes in the
# zero universe) and fixed_width_shapes (the words' candidacy for the
# backend's typed versions); its backend half is fixed_width_prolog_backend
# (the words represented natively, one integer of w bits each); fixed_width
# declares the words' library terms.
#
# prolog_backend_fixed_width_preset        the knowledge a library is
#                                          compiled from
# prolog_backend_fixed_width_type_check    the knowledge of the type-check
#                                          round, the backend's shapes always
#                                          with it
λ export
. (λtuple. tuple λmixin. mixin mixin)
λ omega
. omega (omega (omega corpora "compiler") "prolog_backend_preset")
λ prolog_backend_preset _
. omega (omega (omega corpora "compiler") "prolog_backend_preset")
λ _ prolog_backend_type_check
. omega (omega (omega corpora "compiler") "fixed_width")
λ fixed_width
. omega (omega (omega corpora "compiler") "fixed_width_unions")
λ fixed_width_unions
. omega (omega (omega corpora "compiler") "fixed_width_prolog_backend")
λ fixed_width_prolog_backend
. omega (omega (omega corpora "compiler") "fixed_width_shapes")
λ fixed_width_shapes
. ( λ tuple
    . tuple
      ( fixed_width_shapes
      + fixed_width_prolog_backend
      + fixed_width_unions
      + fixed_width
      + prolog_backend_preset
      )
  )
λ prolog_backend_fixed_width_preset
. (λtuple. tuple (fixed_width_shapes + fixed_width_unions + prolog_backend_type_check))
λ prolog_backend_fixed_width_type_check
. export prolog_backend_fixed_width_preset prolog_backend_fixed_width_type_check
